# biome.json sets lineEnding "lf". Without this, git's autocrlf hands Windows
# checkouts CRLF, biome rewrites them to LF, and every checkout shows the whole
# tree as modified. Normalise on commit and check out LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff2 binary
